<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="bs">
<head>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="/images/book.png">
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Promoviši Oglas - BookExpress</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/style.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/knjiga.css">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/stylesheets/promotions.css">
    <!-- SweetAlert2 CSS -->
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/sweetalert2@11.7.32/dist/sweetalert2.min.css">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('./iskoristivi/header.ejs') %>

<div class="payment-container">
    <div class="promotion-summary">
        <h3>Promoviši svoj oglas</h3>
        <div class="book-info">
            <img src="<%= book.fotografija_url || '/images/placeholder.jpg' %>"
                 alt="<%= book.naziv %>"
                 class="book-image">
            <div class="book-details">
                <h4><%= book.naziv %></h4>
                <p><%= book.autor %></p>
                <p>Cijena: <%= book.cijena.toFixed(2) %> KM</p>
            </div>
        </div>
        <p>Vaša knjiga će biti istaknuta na vrhu pretrage i dobiti će veću vidljivost na platformi.</p>
        <div class="price-highlight">
            <%= promotionPrice.toFixed(2) %> KM
        </div>
    </div>

    <form class="payment-form" id="paymentForm" data-promotion-price="<%= promotionPrice %>">
        <input type="hidden" name="bookId" value="<%= book.id %>">
        <input type="hidden" name="amount" value="<%= promotionPrice %>">

        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="cardNumber">Broj kartice</label>
            <input type="text" id="cardNumber" name="cardNumber" placeholder="1234 5678 9012 3456" maxlength="19" required>
        </div>

        <div class="card-inputs">
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="expiryDate">Datum isteka</label>
                <input type="text" id="expiryDate" name="expiryDate" placeholder="MM/YY" maxlength="5" required>
            </div>
            <div class="form-group">
                <label for="cvv">CVV</label>
                <input type="text" id="cvv" name="cvv" placeholder="123" maxlength="4" required>
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="form-group">
            <label for="cardholderName">Ime vlasnika kartice</label>
            <input type="text" id="cardholderName" name="cardholderName" placeholder="Kenan Boračić" required>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="pay-button" id="payButton">
            <span id="buttonText">Plati <%= promotionPrice.toFixed(2) %> KM</span>
        </button>
    </form>

    <div class="security-notice">
        <h4>Sigurno plaćanje</h4>
        <p>Vaši podaci o kartici su zaštićeni SSL enkripcijom i ne čuvaju se na našem serveru. Koristimo Monri Payments za sigurnu obradu transakcija.</p>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- SweetAlert2 JS -->
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/sweetalert2@11.7.32/dist/sweetalert2.all.min.js"></script>
<!-- CUstom alert funkcije, trebao bi ovako u svakom fajlu primjeniti -->
<script src="/javascripts/alerts.js"></script>
<!-- promotebook-->
<script src="/javascripts/promoteBook.js"></script>

</body>
</html>